  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: DescripcionLibros_en-US
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en-US
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 57b41d0b9577b5847a5faa5415505970, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items: []
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 55986266112
    m_Localized: "In the Kingdom of Teralthor, where the use of magic is punishable
      by death, Liora, an apprentice herbalist, accidentally finds a grimoire buried
      among the roots of an ancient tree. The pages, covered with ancient symbols
      that glow to the touch, whisper forgotten secrets and connect her with Salakhar,
      a deity exiled from the mortal realm. As Liora discovers the book responds
      to her will, witch hunters begin to close in. She must soon decide whether
      to burn the grimoire and live a normal life\u2026 or unleash a magic capable
      of shattering the world\u2019s order."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56003043328
    m_Localized: "In the forgotten corners of an enchanted forest, an ancient creature
      guards a secret that could change the fate of the entire kingdom. Ancient legends
      speak of a powerful artifact hidden among trees that whisper names and paths
      that vanish. Only the brave who decipher the Guardian\u2019s clues can discover
      the truth and decide if that power deserves to be released."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56003043329
    m_Localized: "In a world divided between eternal light and endless darkness,
      two warring kingdoms fight for supremacy. An ancient prophecy foretells the
      arrival of a young woman able to summon both light and shadows. Caught between
      both sides, she must discover her origins, forge unexpected alliances, and
      decide if the world\u2019s balance deserves to be preserved\u2026 or broken
      forever."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56003043330
    m_Localized: A novel of enigmas, secret societies, and cursed books. When a young
      librarian inherits a forbidden tome, she becomes embroiled in an ancient conspiracy
      threatening to resurface. Clues hidden among the pages, messages in invisible
      ink, and keys concealed in the architecture of her own city will guide her
      toward a truth many died to hide.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56003043331
    m_Localized: "When the eccentric bookseller Alina receives a box with no sender
      containing an unknown novel titled \u201CThe Room of Silence,\u201D she doesn\u2019t
      imagine the dark power it hides. In the following days, several customers who
      buy the book disappear without a trace. Security cameras show the impossible:
      readers simply vanish into thin air after turning the last page. With skeptical
      police and her shop in danger, Alina resorts to her detective past to follow
      the clues the book leaves between the lines. But the deeper she goes into its
      mystery, the more blurred the line between fiction and reality becomes."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56003043332
    m_Localized: "In an apparently quiet city, a secret society rules from the shadows.
      An unfinished diary, left by a missing investigator, contains the first clues.
      Mysterious disappearances, coded messages, and forgotten symbols point to a
      power that could alter history\u2019s course if someone manages to unravel
      the mystery."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56003043333
    m_Localized: A treatise on magical balms, ointments, and lotions. From creams
      that reveal invisible beings to salves that allow walking without leaving a
      trace, this book compiles the knowledge of wandering herbalists and hermit
      druids. It is said the pages are made of real, living leaves that react to
      the touch of those intending to heal... or to hunt.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56003043334
    m_Localized: "A burning book \u2014 literally \u2014 that stays warm to the touch.
      It contains recipes for potions that awaken inner strength, increase courage
      in battle, and, in some cases, provoke uncontrollable emotional outbursts.
      Each chapter is based on basic human emotions: anger, desire, fear, hope. Ideal
      for war alchemists, charming barbarians, and poets with a dangerous side."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56003043335
    m_Localized: This tome is a compendium of potions that alter perception of the
      world, from seeing the passage of the dead to hearing the thoughts of plants.
      Written by an alchemist who spent twenty years in complete isolation in the
      Silent Forests, the book offers recipes only for those daring enough to look
      beyond the veil of reality. Not suitable for impressionable readers or those
      anxious to keep their sanity.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56003043336
    m_Localized: A complete compilation of magical flora, separated into healing
      and cursed species. It includes warnings about handling and case records where
      these plants altered not only the body but also the will of those who used
      them. Some, it is said, can only be harvested after whispering their true name
      at dusk.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56003043337
    m_Localized: "This voluminous illustrated tome contains detailed descriptions
      of herbs and flowers with magical properties. From the Dream Water Lily, which
      induces prophetic visions, to the Truth Bramble, capable of forcing anyone
      who touches it to confess their deepest secrets. Each plant responds differently
      depending on the lunar phase and the collector\u2019s intent."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56003043338
    m_Localized: A disturbing compendium that collects stories and recipes of the
      most dangerous and vengeful fungi in the realm. From the Spore Shadow, which
      whispers curses into the ear of anyone who steps on it, to the Vengeful Stinkhorn,
      able to sprout in the most inconvenient places when someone holds a grudge.
      It includes methods to summon, calm, or, in emergencies, fry these creatures
      with enchanted butter.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56003043339
    m_Localized: A culinary guide of exotic ingredients, coming from lands that only
      exist in whispers and incomplete maps. Flowers that sing at dusk, spices that
      light up the darkness, and fruits that can revive memories of past lives. This
      book gathers traditions from nomadic cooks and herbal witches who traveled
      beyond the limits of the known world.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56003043340
    m_Localized: 'Sacred cookbook of the nocturnal clans, written under the light
      of countless full moons. Each dish not only satisfies hunger but triggers ancient
      magical effects: sweets that induce prophetic dreams, stews that ward off spirits,
      and desserts that heal the soul of the afflicted. An invitation to cook with
      the magic that breathes in every ingredient.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56003043341
    m_Localized: "Rigorous investigation about the eclipse that stopped time for
      seven days centuries ago. The records tell how magic was altered, portals opened,
      and creatures crossed the veil. It includes survivors\u2019 testimonies and
      fragments of forbidden texts that narrate how that event changed the course
      of magical history forever."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56003043342
    m_Localized: Exhaustive chronicle of the feats, betrayals, and tragedies of vanished
      civilizations. It recounts the rise and fall of kingdoms that once ruled the
      known world, leaving ruins and relics imbued with ancient magic. A compendium
      of battles, forgotten heroes, and artifacts that still lie buried underground.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56003043343
    m_Localized: "A collection of chilling tales about things lurking where least
      expected: under the bed, behind the mirror, or in a room closed for years.
      Each story comes with warnings and folk legends whispered to protect the unwary\u2026
      though sometimes, even that is not enough."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56003043344
    m_Localized: "For centuries, the Montalban Library has stood, though no one remembers
      the last time its darkest corners were dusted. Jacinto, its new night librarian,
      starts noticing unsettling details: books changing places, whispers in unknown
      languages, shadows crossing empty halls. When he discovers some books are written
      in blood and tell of events yet to occur, he realizes he is not alone\u2026
      and the shelves, if one listens closely, have a memory. And hunger."
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 56003043345
    m_Localized: Anthology of forbidden tales, collected by a hermit who claims to
      have traveled to the darkest corners of the world. Stories of voices echoing
      in empty rooms, shadows mimicking human movements, and sharp laughter on the
      other side of the mirror. A book that, it is said, never stays still where
      it is left.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  references:
    version: 2
    RefIds: []
